# Settings changed remotely: edit this file in GitHub (or ask Claude to) and the server picks
# it up on its next auto-update (~5 min, with a restart). These win over .env.
# Never put keys or tokens here: anything named *KEY*, *TOKEN*, *SECRET* is ignored.
# Settings changed with /set in Discord win over this file (/settings shows where each comes from).
#
# To make these permanent, follow each change-log entry's action in your server's .env:
#   CHANGE = the setting is already in .env: edit that line (don't add a second copy)
#   ADD    = .env doesn't have it yet: add the line
# then delete it here (or ask Claude to). /envchanges in Discord checks your .env and says which.
#
# ---- Change log (newest first): date · CHANGE/ADD · setting · old → new · why ---------------
# 2026-10-26 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB → NBA,NFL,MLB · main leagues only for daily jobs and leagueless asks (NHL still works when named)
# 2026-10-26 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PRETIP_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB → NBA,NFL,MLB · pre-tip scans for the main leagues
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_PRETIP_RESERVE · (none) → 0.3 · 30% of each day's budget held for pre-tip scans and closing reads
# 2026-10-26 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PLAYS_CACHE_MINUTES · 30 → 10 (back) · fresher prices; the self-pacing budget now caps the spend (net: same as 10/24, no change needed in .env if you already set 10)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_DAILY_CREDITS · (none: 700) → auto · today's budget = credits left / days until they refill; background scans stop at it (CHANGE if your .env has it)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_NEWS_POSTS · (none) → off (default, not set) · injury/goalie/pitcher news recorded and used in every scan, no alert posts (on brings the posts back)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_CREDIT_RESET_DAY · (none) → 21 · the day your Odds API credits refill
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_MAX_FAVORITE · (none) → -250 · no leg or pick heavier than -250 in any mode (little upside, still loses 1 in 4+)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_VOLUME_MIN_PROB · (none: 0.75) → 0.65 · parlay legs can exist under the -250 cap (-250 already implies 71%)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_MAX_STAKE_PCT · (none: 2) → 5 · middle bankroll plan: straight bets up to 5% (CHANGE if your .env has it)
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_PARLAY_STAKE_PCT · (none: 1) → 3 · middle plan: parlays with an edge up to 3%
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_FUN_STAKE_PCT · (none: 0.5) → 1 · middle plan: no-edge parlays 1%
# 2026-10-26 · ADD · LINEMAKER_KELLY · (none: 0.25) → 0.5 · half Kelly so stakes reach the middle plan's range (CHANGE if your .env has it)
# 2026-10-26 · TEMPORARY · LINEMAKER_ALT_LINES_UNTIL · → 2026-10-26 23:59 · alt lines past the budget for the rest of today; expires by itself, don't copy to .env
# 2026-10-25 · TEMPORARY (expired) · LINEMAKER_ALT_LINES_UNTIL · (none) → 2026-10-25 23:59 · alt lines past the daily budget until tonight; expires by itself, don't copy to .env
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · ODDS_API_BOOKMAKERS · (none: all US books) → fanduel,draftkings,pinnacle,betmgm,williamhill_us,betrivers,fanatics,bovada,betonlineag,lowvig · adds Pinnacle (sharpest book) to the fair price, same credits as the US region (10 books = 1 region). If your .env already has this line, CHANGE it instead
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MIN · (none) → -130 · live parlay legs no longer than -130 (was -150 earlier today: graded live legs hit above their estimate)
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_ODDS_MAX · (none) → -450 · live parlay legs no heavier than -450
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_MIN_PROB · (none) → 0.66 · live parlay legs need a 66%+ hit chance (was 0.72 earlier today: graded live 60-80% reads hit 4-10 pts above their estimate)
# 2026-10-25 · ADD · LINEMAKER_LIVE_PARLAY_LEGS · (none) → 6 · live auto-parlays up to 6 legs, each size shown only while its EV stays above -3% (was 3 earlier today)
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PLAYS_CACHE_MINUTES · 30 → 10 · fresher prices on every ask (credits to spare)
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_PRETIP_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL → NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB · MLB pre-game + closing reads (lineups, starters)
# 2026-10-24 · CHANGE · LINEMAKER_SPORTS · NBA,NFL,NHL → NBA,NFL,NHL,MLB · MLB pitcher-change alerts, daily MLB game-line tracking
#
# ---- Active settings (one per line) -------------------------------------------------------
LINEMAKER_SPORTS=NBA,NFL,MLB
